1
00:00:04,094 --> 00:00:05,394
They're still behind us.

2
00:00:06,736 --> 00:00:07,414
How far?

3
00:00:08,041 --> 00:00:10,367
Twenty kilometres. Closing.

4
00:00:14,239 --> 00:00:16,346
Can we make the lake before dark?

5
00:00:19,502 --> 00:00:20,002
No.

6
00:00:29,257 --> 00:00:30,677
They're not chasing me.

7
00:00:31,233 --> 00:00:31,733
No.

8
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:35,730
They want what's in the box.

9
00:00:38,291 --> 00:00:40,471
Vig. Say it.

10
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:43,370
They want it dead.

11
00:01:04,488 --> 00:01:05,828
There it is.

12
00:01:07,564 --> 00:01:08,964
Still warm.

13
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:14,180
Riders. Take the cargo intact.

14
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:17,300
The rider doesn't matter.

15
00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:24,720
Three.

16
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,280
Coming fast.

17
00:01:32,828 --> 00:01:34,159
Don't stop moving.

18
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:50,060
Two left.

19
00:01:55,981 --> 00:01:57,501
Cargo intact.

20
00:01:57,820 --> 00:01:58,840
He's running for the lake.

21
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,200
Torv, turn.

22
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:06,780
We go through it.

23
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:10,100
Now, Torv!

24
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:11,220
Now!

25
00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:53,160
What are you doing?

26
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,160
You're a machine.

27
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,800
Why do you look at them?

28
00:03:02,470 --> 00:03:03,950
Because nobody built them.

29
00:03:05,110 --> 00:03:07,250
Everything else out here was made for something.

30
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:09,530
A tool. A weapon. A machine.

31
00:03:10,090 --> 00:03:11,190
They weren't made for anything.

32
00:03:11,650 --> 00:03:12,450
They just are.

33
00:03:15,050 --> 00:03:16,610
...And that matters to you?

34
00:03:17,330 --> 00:03:19,070
It's the only thing that does.

35
00:03:43,070 --> 00:03:44,670
Get down, please.

36
00:03:49,100 --> 00:03:49,740
No.

37
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:53,920
Then we'll talk like this.

38
00:03:55,432 --> 00:03:58,152
You're carrying something that should have stayed buried.

39
00:03:58,540 --> 00:03:59,240
It's a man.

40
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:02,146
It stopped being a man...

41
00:04:02,146 --> 00:04:02,860
...a long time ago.

42
00:04:03,940 --> 00:04:05,200
He has a name.

43
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,760
It remembers the world before this one.

44
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:09,840
That's enough.

45
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:11,200
Enough for what?

46
00:04:12,100 --> 00:04:12,600
Enough.

47
00:04:14,522 --> 00:04:16,582
Some things don't get to come back.

48
00:04:20,050 --> 00:04:21,850
Hand it over and ride home...

49
00:04:21,850 --> 00:04:22,350
...to your children.

50
00:04:23,570 --> 00:04:25,430
Give them five minutes.

51
00:04:50,290 --> 00:04:51,670
Open the door.

52
00:05:16,100 --> 00:05:17,620
They're faster than us.

53
00:05:17,900 --> 00:05:18,460
How many?

54
00:05:20,921 --> 00:05:22,001
All of them.

55
00:05:34,350 --> 00:05:36,667
Torv ,Take it and go!

56
00:05:36,667 --> 00:05:37,167
Go!

57
00:06:07,634 --> 00:06:08,394
Vig!

58
00:06:09,726 --> 00:06:10,606
Vig!

59
00:06:25,167 --> 00:06:26,446
Haldr.

60
00:06:27,255 --> 00:06:28,383
Three left.

61
00:06:47,502 --> 00:06:48,662
Haldr.

62
00:06:49,710 --> 00:06:50,395
I'm out of—

63
00:06:56,009 --> 00:06:57,704
Vig!

64
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,260
I can't see anything.

65
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:37,640
General. There's a storm coming in.

66
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,380
We've lost the signal on all six.

67
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,600
...Say that again.

68
00:08:31,150 --> 00:08:31,690
You waited.

69
00:08:33,190 --> 00:08:33,909
Let's go.

70
00:08:35,690 --> 00:08:36,650
Still with me?

71
00:08:56,261 --> 00:08:57,757
Open the gates.

72
00:09:08,068 --> 00:09:09,208
Nine days.

73
00:09:10,246 --> 00:09:11,933
I didn't think you'd come back.

74
00:09:24,930 --> 00:09:25,696
Where's Vig?

75
00:09:28,318 --> 00:09:29,498
Under the lake.

76
00:09:43,450 --> 00:09:44,090
Air.

77
00:09:45,530 --> 00:09:47,170
They told me you were the secret.

78
00:09:47,590 --> 00:09:49,050
The thing that saves us.

79
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:51,750
Did they mention the rest of me...

80
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:54,681
...isn't coming?
I saw one of them. Walking.

81
00:09:55,070 --> 00:09:56,270
Did it look at you?

82
00:09:56,670 --> 00:09:57,190
Yes.

83
00:09:58,030 --> 00:09:59,230
And it kept walking.

